Z||000000||deceler8||11-08-1999||06:28 PM||||Joined a month or so ago. I'm in Sioux City, Iowa and last weekend I had a chance to visit the clubhouse in Onawa, Iowa. <P>Pretty nice place...has accomodations for overnight guests and kitchen, and probably a four or five bay garage. Incredibly nice facility. And Paul Duff is a very knowledgeable and nice guy. Can't wait for the next club event.<P>And of course he has at least four Fieros that I counted.||||reg||10
